{"id":"remmina","name":"Remmina","tagline":"Remote Desktop Client","blurb":"Remmina is a remote-desktop client written in GTK, to use other desktops remotely, from a tiny screen or large monitors.","description":"Remmina is a remote-desktop client written in GTK, to\nuse other desktops remotely, from a tiny screen or large monitors.\n\nRemmina supports multiple network protocols in an integrated and\nconsistent user interface. The protocols currently supported are:\nX2Go, RDP (Remote Desktop Protocol), VNC (Virtual Network Computing),\nand SSH (Secure Shell / Open SSH).\n\nExternal plugins are also supported to add new protocols and features.","developer":"Hiroyuki_Tanaka","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/icons/128x128/org.remmina.Remmina.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-1_752x423@1.png","w":1024,"h":576},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-2_1248x702@1.png","w":1296,"h":729},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-3_1248x702@1.png","w":1296,"h":729},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/remmina/Remmina/25c1e58ee7a9bb3b88dbb89f0083eab8/screenshots/image-4_1248x702@1.png","w":1296,"h":729}],"categories":["Developer Tools","Networking"],"tags":["network"],"license":"GPL-2.0+","platforms":["linux"],"h